            "question_id": 16871,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "uk",
            "hint": "Побудуй речення про попередній процес у Past Perfect Continuous. Почни з питальної частини або допоміжного дієслова; обставини залиш після дієслівної групи. Що вона робила інакше перед тим, як результати покращилися?",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:06.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:06.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 13995,
            "question_id": 16871,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the question phrase or auxiliary; keep other circumstances after the verb group. Ask about a changed prior practice that preceded better results.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:06.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:06.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 13996,
            "question_id": 16871,
            "provider": "polyglot-v3",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: do. In a direct question the auxiliary precedes the subject, with the question phrase first. Preserve the relation to the later past event.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:06.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:51:06.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 13997,
